<title>USA: Manufacturers' Services hires Stratus CFO.</title>
<headline>Manufacturers' Services hires Stratus CFO.</headline>
<dateline>CONCORD, Mass. 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Manufacturers' Services Ltd, a provider of electronics manufacturing services, said Wednesday that it has named Robert Donahue chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Manufacturers' said Donahue joins the company from Stratus Computer Inc, where he was CFO and vice president of finance and administration.</p>
</text>
